OL,3,GNEWSASeventh man arrested after Black
OL,4,ACountry shooting
OL,5,
OL,6,FA seventh person has been arrested
OL,7,Fafter gun shots were fired on a Black
OL,8,FCountry street, according to West
OL,9,FMidlands Police.
OL,11,FThe man, aged 27, was arrested on
OL,12,FSaturday evening, on suspicion of
OL,13,Fpossession of a firearm following the
OL,14,Fdisturbance on Temple Road, Willenhall,
OL,15,Fat about 17:45 BST on Friday.
OL,17,FSix other men were arrested on
OL,18,Fsuspicion of affray as part of the
OL,19,Finvestigation, while one person was
OL,20,Fhurt, but no one is believed to have
OL,21,Fsuffered gunshot injuries.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
